OL,3,AUS officials to update on deadly
OL,4,AFlorida jet crash as reports name
OL,5,A20-year-old as copilot
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS officials are set to give an update
OL,8,Fafter a jet crashed in Florida on
OL,9,FSunday, killing all nine people on
OL,10,Fboard
OL,12,FUS media have reported that one of the
OL,13,Fvictims was the plane's 20-year-old
OL,14,Fcopilot. Nobody on the ground was hurt
OL,16,FThe National Transportation Safety
OL,17,FBoard is investigating the incident and
OL,18,Fis set to provide an update shortly
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
