OL,6,
OL,7,FThe crash happened near Cresthaven,
OL,8,Fsome nine miles (14 km) from
OL,9,FMar-a-Lago, President Donald Trump's
OL,10,Fresort in the wealthy enclave of Palm
OL,11,FBeach County
